  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BNB and Social Accountability Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to train the community members as well as duty bearers in the use of the Social and Public Accountability Score Card as a tool for data gathering as well as monitoring and evaluating the performance in the service delivery sector, in Zimbabwe.

The project will strengthen the capacity of CSOs and ordinary citizens to demand accountability from service providers and duty bearers and facilitate interaction between government, public service providers and CSOs. It will do this through: 
 &#x2022; providing up-to-date, reliable and verifiable information on the poverty situation in rural and urban areas of Zimbabwe;
&#x2022; strengthening the capacity of civil society organizations and residents associations 
&#x2022; strengthening existing dialogue mechanisms among residents, state and non-state actors at local level</narrative>
  </description>
